# Optional for serving. The demo remains fully usable with generated poster
# artwork when empty. Required by the offline catalog jobs that talk to TMDB:
# `make tmdb-ingest` (docs/data/tmdb-metadata.md) and the persona fixture
# enrichment in synthetic/personas/. Never commit a real value — this repo is
# public, and the jobs read the token from the environment and nowhere else.
TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN=
